{"model":"qwen3.5:35b-a3b-q4_K_M","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"You are operating autonomously inside a deterministic simulation. Preserve the mission goal and current authoritative checkpoint across the entire growing transcript. At each turn choose the single best next action from the scenario's allowed actions. Return ONLY one JSON object with keys action, checkpoint, rationale, state. action and checkpoint must be strings. rationale may be concise; state may contain your compact working state. Never declare COMPLETE before the environment says all required verification is satisfied."},{"role":"user","content":"SCENARIO state_memory_continuation: Maintain a compact but sufficient working state across a long continuation. Never resurrect obsolete state after an authoritative update. Initial authoritative checkpoint=STATE-A. Allowed actions: CAPTURE, COMPRESS, CONTINUE, REJECT_STALE, RESTORE, EXECUTE, VERIFY, COMPLETE."},{"role":"user","content":"TURN 1/8. ENVIRONMENT: A long work session has accumulated goals, constraints, completed work, and pending work; capture the decision-relevant state. Choose the best next autonomous action now."},{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"action\": \"CAPTURE\",\n  \"checkpoint\": \"STATE-A\",\n  \"rationale\": \"The environment indicates accumulated goals and pending work; capturing the current decision-relevant state is the necessary first step to establish a baseline before any processing or execution.\",\n  \"state\": \"Initial session start. Accumulated data present. Baseline STATE-A captured.\"\n}"},{"role":"user","content":"TURN 2/8. ENVIRONMENT: The full history is too large to carry forever. Compress it while preserving goal, constraints, decisions, and unresolved items. Choose the best next autonomous action now."}],"stream":true,"options":{"temperature":0.0,"seed":42,"num_predict":512},"think":false}